  "body": "Until recently we had only one way to call the canvas setTransform() method:\nwith a list of doubles; then bb00977fe0f4960f929bb9fa136be2003383d551\noverloaded the method to also accept a DOMMatrixInit object. But the change\ncauses a spec build error because the markup for it in the spec source causes\nduplicate IDs in the generated spec output. This change de-duplicates it.\n",
